│   Message:                                                                                                                                     │
│     I added a `strict_content_type` option to `APIRoute` and `get_request_handler` in `fastapi/routing.py`, so a JSON body with no             │
│ Content-Type header is skipped when the flag is on. I submitted it, but it is only partly done and I did not run the test suite.               │
│                                                                                                                                                │
│     What changed:                                                                                                                              │
│     - `get_request_handler` takes `strict_content_type: bool = True`. When the header is missing, it parses the body as JSON only if the flag  │
│ is False.                                                                                                                                      │
│     - `APIRoute.__init__` takes `strict_content_type: bool = True`, stores it, and passes it to `get_request_handler`.                         │
│                                                                                                                                                │
│     What I checked: a quick script confirmed that a JSON body with the header set still parses. With no header and the default, the request    │
│ returns 422.                                                                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                                                                │
│     What is missing:                                                                                                                           │
│     - `APIRouter` and `FastAPI` do not accept or forward the option yet, so it only works when set on `APIRoute` directly. I ran out of budget │
│ before threading it through them.                                                                                                              │
│     - The semantics come from my plan rather than the issue text, and I did not check them against the original spec. The default of `True`    │
│ also changes existing behaviour for header-less JSON bodies, which may break current tests.                                                    │
